WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.395
Week: seven daily columns and synthetic session digests

00:00:03.395 --> 00:00:07.076
Day: a midnight boundary belongs to its last-activity day

00:00:07.076 --> 00:00:10.213
List: four synthetic sessions, grouped by activity day

00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:14.664
Peek: first prompt, last prompt and closing response; no analysis

00:00:14.664 --> 00:00:17.400
Transcript: read the imported conversation across the full pane

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:25.040
Reload: load the same imported conversation again
